OL,3,ATributes as wife and daughter of DUP
OL,4,Achairman Lord Morrow die hours apart
OL,5,
OL,6,FSympathies have been expressed to a
OL,7,Fsenior Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,8,Fpolitician following the death of his
OL,9,Fwife and daughter within hours of each
OL,10,Fother.
OL,12,FThe party said Lord Morrow, who is
OL,13,Fchairman of the DUP, lost his wife Lady
OL,14,FJennifer Morrow and their daughter
OL,15,FRachel Burrows at the weekend.
OL,17,FDUP leader Gavin Robinson said that
OL,18,F"words cannot adequately express the
OL,19,Fheartbreak and sorrow felt across our
OL,20,Fparty".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
